SUMMARY:Rainbow Dance Party with Gay Agenda
DESCRIPTION:For this special Pride edition of our Saturday DJ Dance Party\, we’ll be decked out in rainbows while you dance the night away under a ceiling of glittering disco balls! Sip on your favorite cocktails on the deck while you take a dance break and enjoy the rooftop breezes. Special Pride drinks\, no cover\, 21+ with valid ID to enter.
